## Risk Map

| Risk | Applies | What the interviewer may test | Evidence-backed response |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| short tenure |  | judgment, learning, recurrence |  |
| career changes |  | consistency and direction |  |
| leadership ambiguity |  | direct reports and authority |  |
| customer-contact ambiguity |  | direct vs mediated contact |  |
| delivery ambiguity |  | production vs internal tool vs PoC |  |
| AI-assisted work |  | personal competence and verification |  |
| lesser-known certification |  | domain and official level |  |
| language gap |  | practical work communication |  |
| residence status |  | start and support logistics |  |

