## Core Coverage

- [ ] `CORE`: self-introduction and career summary
- [ ] `MOTIVE`: why change, role, company and now
- [ ] `HISTORY`: why join and leave every employer
- [ ] `EVIDENCE`: hardest project, role, artifact and result
- [ ] `LEAD`: formal leadership and coordination boundaries
- [ ] `BEHAVIOR`: failure, conflict, feedback and deadlines
- [ ] role overlay: technical / consulting / another role
- [ ] `FOREIGN` when relevant
- [ ] `FINAL`: compensation, start, location and commitment
- [ ] reverse questions

