## Final Consistency Check

- [ ] dates, titles and employer names match submitted documents
- [ ] every number has an evidence ID
- [ ] every project distinguishes own role from team result
- [ ] no level inflation in leadership or system-delivery claims
- [ ] AI usage and human verification are separated
- [ ] lesser-known certificates are not declared equivalent without an official mapping
- [ ] answers sound natural when spoken and are not memorized word-for-word
- [ ] current company and role research is dated and linked
